se-item img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }\n.footer { background: #004c99; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 10px 20px; position: relative; bottom: 0; width: 100%; }\ninput[type=\"text\"], input[type=\"password\"], input[type=\"email\"] { width: 100%; padding: 8px; margin: 5px 0; display: inline-block; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-sizing: border-box; }\ninput[type=\"submit\"] { background-color: #0056b3; color: white; padding: 14px 20px; margin: 8px 0; border: none; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; }\ninput[type=\"submit\"]:hover { background-color: #004c99; }"
